
A clean, modern, and fully responsive **Contact Form UI** built with HTML and CSS.

This project is lightweight, easy to customize, and suitable for business websites, portfolios, agencies, landing pages, and personal websites.

## 🔗 Project Links

- **GitHub Repository:** https://github.com/davnasir/contarct-From
- **HTML File:** https://github.com/davnasir/contarct-From/blob/main/contactfrom.html

## ✨ Features

- 📱 Fully Responsive Design
- 🎨 Modern & Clean UI
- 📝 Name Input Field
- 📧 Email Input Field
- 📌 Subject Input Field
- 💬 Message Textarea
- 🔘 Modern Submit Button
- ⚡ Lightweight & Fast
- 🧩 Easy to Customize
- 💻 HTML & CSS Based

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3

